OL,3,GNEWSAHouse of Keys members given
OL,4,Adepartmental positions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man Government has
OL,7,Fannounced a series of political
OL,8,Fappointments to government departments
OL,9,Fand public bodies following the general
OL,10,Felection on 24 September.
OL,12,FThe appointments were confirmed on
OL,13,FFriday following the formation of the
OL,14,FCouncil of Ministers last week.
OL,16,FChief Minister Chris Thomas said the
OL,17,Fgovernment had moved quickly to fill
OL,18,Fkey political roles.
OL,20,F"I am grateful to Tynwald members who
OL,21,Fhave stepped forward and taken on these
OL,22,Fimportant responsibilities," he said.
